            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:42:25.082431+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point you get [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e) combine it with [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead) to maximize your survivability and be less dependent on healers, how many times have you hid in a corner waiting for a healer? Wait no more, shoot at the floor and heal yourself! \n\nIdeally you should already have [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), these two are good to boost your DPS by both increasing raw damage and firing speed, i personally dislike just boosting one or the other, boosting both seems, to me at least, best.\n\nAs mentioned in the optional item [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), If you money allows it, buy it. If selling [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is what allows you to buy it, do it. Trust, shooting this hard this early in the game is gonna put you in an excellent position in the next few rounds.\n\nThe two green items are just there to fill in the blanks, if i put something more expensive the round-to-round attainability goes off the window, and most people will not know with which low-tier items replace the listed high-tier item a certain build is expecting you to get, so if you have more money consider the optional items, if not get what i list. And again you can change it up if you feel like your style is somewhere else, or you feel other items help you better.",
