                    "notes": "This along with reload therapy will boost your survival by a lot.\nAt some point you should have enough bullets to not fully reload the gun and still fully heal you, never fully reloaded, never fully empty, this means in an emergency you can easily heal 20-30% health if you reload fully.\nOr if you have time, just shoot random bullets and reload to heal.",
