            "notes": "At this point you should have enough money for both [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), so have those two along with [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\nThose 4 should help you do a lot of damage, but that's not all, you can go with [Tripod](item_6fe6f8a3-e4ef-4333-b802-6f43c65ddd8b) if the map allow you to get constant high-ground.\n\nI also list two survival items in case you need them, replace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and  [Tripod](item_6fe6f8a3-e4ef-4333-b802-6f43c65ddd8b), not the rest.",
