            "created_at": "2025-08-28T03:42:25.082431+00:00",
            "notes": "The powers, can diverge into two from here.\n\nYou can go [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) first and then [Head Honcho](item_bbd85437-5add-424c-83e7-309a7ff7f447) or the other way around.\nIn S18 they got buffed [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) reloads bullets, and those bullets now heal you when combined with [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e).\nAnd [Head Honcho](item_bbd85437-5add-424c-83e7-309a7ff7f447) now doesn't reset once you reload, allowing you to quickly shoot a few bullets, boost your first shot and really deal some damage to the enemies you actually want to kill.\nYou can go either of the two first, whichever you feel like needing.\n\nNow about the items, if money allows it absolutely get [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce). \nIf it doesn't allow it, then get [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if you need to pick off aerial targets like Mercy, Juno, Freya and maybe Genji.\nGet [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) to do extra damage to heavy armored targets.\nGet  [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) if you want to break a Shield, sometimes it's quite useful to constantly leave them without their main source of cover.\n\nI leave [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) in because... well it's better than an empty space but in case you really need survival and money allows it, then get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) or even [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you can afford it.\n\nThis survival items might be more important than [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) depending on your situation.",
