            "notes": "At this point you should have enough  money to buy almost anything, but at the same time, you are here because the match is that even.\n\nSo we go with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) for maximum DPS.\n\nI like to have [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and  [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead), gives a good boost of shooting speed and extra bullets along with fast reload to get back to shooting faster. The more you are shooting the more damage you get to do, though this doesn't mean you shouldn't have target priority.\n\nLastly i like [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for survivability, its a goodie and gives you a lot of Lifesteal and a bit of AP and WP, if you need a bit more survivability, this might be it.\n\nI put in [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) but it's not a must, it's just there for show, check the optionals, see what works for your situation best.",
